
Refreshed for FFmpeg 9.1 (deb-multimedia 10:9.1-dmo1), 2026-11-26: deb-multimedia dropped this patch in 9.1-dmo1 because it no longer applies; the edition keeps xfade easing (the easing and reverse options shipped since +15). The six wrap-around hunks of the slide transitions are left out: FFmpeg 9.1 has its own fix for them (16a4ce48c, Lynne, vf_xfade: fix the wrap-around of the slide transitions).

